Keep a shared word as empty text.
Place "ababcbacadefegdehijhklij" into word.
Keep a shared last as 0.
Keep a shared finish as 0.
Keep a shared cursor as 0.
To extend.
Repeat while cursor is at most finish.
The symbol is the slice of word from cursor to cursor plus 1.
The far is cursor.
For every probe from cursor to last, if the slice of word from probe to probe plus 1 matches symbol, set far to probe.
If far is more than finish, set finish to far.
Add 1 to cursor.

The end is the last position of word.
Set last to end.
The answers is an empty list of whole numbers.
The begin is 0.
Repeat while begin is at most last.
Set finish to begin.
Set cursor to begin.
Extend.
The width is finish minus begin plus 1.
Place width into answers.
Set begin to finish plus 1.

For each width in answers, show width.
